---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AMAZON } from '../data/shop';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy & Disclosures" description="Privacy policy, cookie usage and affiliate disclosure for Table for Two.">
  <section class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy & disclosures</h1>
    <p><em>Template: review it and adapt it to your situation (or use a generator such as Termly or iubenda) before you apply to ad networks.</em></p>
    <h2>Advertising & cookies</h2>
    <p>This site may use third-party advertising companies (such as Google AdSense) to show ads. These companies may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising in your Google Ad Settings.</p>
    <h2>Embedded content (Spotify)</h2>
    <p>Some recipe pages include an embedded Spotify player for the suggested playlist. Spotify may set cookies and collect usage data when the player loads, under Spotify's own privacy policy. "Listen on Spotify" buttons simply link to Spotify's website.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We may use privacy-friendly analytics to understand which recipes people enjoy. This data is aggregated and not used to identify you.</p>
    <h2>Email newsletter</h2>
    <p>If you subscribe, we store your email address only to send you the newsletter. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you buy through them, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.{AMAZON.tag && ' As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.'} We only recommend gear we'd actually use.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>.prose { max-width: 760px; padding: 56px 0; } h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.4em; }</style>
